{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate the sum of squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        odd_number = 2 * i - 1\n        total_sum += odd_number * odd_number\n    return total_sum"}
